{"unit_id":"dpskh__dsh-rewind#card-zh","repo":"dpskh/dsh-rewind","commit":"295f41d3189a07612545b2044dd1460444455822","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"@dpskh/tool-rewind 是一个面向 DSH 的上下文管理插件，通过 checkpoint 标记探索起点，并注册 rewind 工具和 ctx.rewind 服务。调用后，它选择标记之后、当前 rewind 调用之前的完整会话片段，使用 ctx.llm 生成报告，再用报告替换模型可见历史中的探索过程，同时保留持久日志。它会检查工具调用边界、区域是否变化以及报告是否缩短，并在失败时保留原区域以便重试。适合希望压缩调查过程、保留结论和证据并继续会话的 DSH 用户；需要同时安装 checkpoint 插件，并提供可解析的模型路由。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:106-160","src/region.ts:73-117"]}
{"unit_id":"dpskh__dsh-rewind#card-en","repo":"dpskh/dsh-rewind","commit":"295f41d3189a07612545b2044dd1460444455822","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"@dpskh/tool-rewind adds a DSH rewind tool and service. It summarizes the balanced exploration after a checkpoint with ctx.llm, replacing visible history while retaining the durable log. Requires the checkpoint plugin and a model route.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:106-160","src/region.ts:73-117"]}
